<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Learn to construct vehicles capable of travelling above the ground, such as a mosquito helicopter and a smuggler cargo airplane.-->
  <VVE_AerialVehicles.description>学习制造能在空中飞行的载具，例如飞蚊直升机和贩夫运输机。</VVE_AerialVehicles.description>
  <VVE_AerialVehicles.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->flying machines-->
    <li>subject-&gt;大铁鸟</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->created helicopters and cargo planes to fly over obstacles-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;造出直升飞机或固定翼飞机以飞跃天险</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->opened up new ways to explore and trade-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;开辟前所未有的道路</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->made air travel possible, changing how we see the world-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;从全新的角度看待这个世界</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->taking to the skies-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;天空就此触手可得</li>
  </VVE_AerialVehicles.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: aerial vehicles-->
  <VVE_AerialVehicles.label>飞行载具</VVE_AerialVehicles.label>
  <!--EN: Learn to construct basic, inefficient vehicles, from prowler buggy to roadkill single-person tanks.-->
  <VVE_BasicVehicles.description>学习制造最基础的简易载具，例如漫步车和路霸轻型坦克。</VVE_BasicVehicles.description>
  <VVE_BasicVehicles.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->first vehicles-->
    <li>subject-&gt;俺寻思这东西能动</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->started making simple vehicles like buggies and single-person tanks-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;开始制造例如漫步车和单人坦克这些简易载具</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->changed how far we could go and what we could carry-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;世界在我们眼中开始变小</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->made travel faster than ever before-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;我们能以全新的速度游览路途</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->inventing new ways to move-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;出行从此不必再有脚步声</li>
  </VVE_BasicVehicles.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: basic vehicles-->
  <VVE_BasicVehicles.label>基础载具</VVE_BasicVehicles.label>
  <!--EN: Learn to construct complex combat vehicles, such as bulldog battle tanks, tango armored personnel carriers and warbird combat airplanes.-->
  <VVE_CombatVehicles.description>学习制造复杂的专业战斗载具，例如恶犬主战坦克，悍匪装甲运兵车和军鸟战斗机。</VVE_CombatVehicles.description>
  <VVE_CombatVehicles.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->war vehicles-->
    <li>subject-&gt;战争机器</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->made powerful combat vehicles like tanks and armored planes-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;制造主战坦克和战斗机这些强大的战争机器</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->vehicles could now fight and defend in wars-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;让机器参与进人类的战争</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->changed how battles are fought with these new machines-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;用这些全新的载具改变战场的形势</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->building for battle-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;为战而生</li>
  </VVE_CombatVehicles.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: combat vehicles-->
  <VVE_CombatVehicles.label>战斗载具</VVE_CombatVehicles.label>
  <!--EN: Learn to construct complex vehicles, such as wagons, roadrunners and snatchers, using the components you can easily fabricate.-->
  <VVE_ComplexVehicles.description>学习利用多种载具部件制造复杂的载具，例如轿车，跑腿卡车和掠袭运输车。</VVE_ComplexVehicles.description>
  <VVE_ComplexVehicles.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->better vehicles-->
    <li>subject-&gt;更快更高更强</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->built more complex vehicles like wagons and fast cars-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;造出更快更好用的轿车。</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->made it easier to move things and people over long distances-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;给远距离旅行带来便利</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->vehicles became more useful and versatile-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;载具从此变得更加轻便易用</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->improving our rides-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;舒舒服服上路吧</li>
  </VVE_ComplexVehicles.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: complex vehicles-->
  <VVE_ComplexVehicles.label>复杂载具</VVE_ComplexVehicles.label>
</LanguageData>
